  "description": "# Device connector protocol\n\nThis package contains the Data Transfer Objects and the serializers that constitute the\ncommunication protocol between the SDK library and the device connector.\n\n## Documentation and Support\n\nFor documentation, release notes, support, and other information please visit the Jabra Developer Zone on https://developer.jabra.com.",
