  "releaseNotes": "## [1.4.0.2] - 2024-11-20\n\n### Added\n\n- Support for feature negotiation between the SDK and the Device Connector.\n- A GNP feature that allows the use of GNP messages instead of sending GNP over HID.\n- A message to signal when a call lock is released.\n\n### Security\n\n- Added code signing for bundled dependencies to enhance security and integrity of the application. Binaries are signed with following subject `CN=GN Audio, O=GN Audio, L=Ballerup, S=Capital Region, C=DK`. NuGet package signing certificate remains the same.",
